"notes":{
"tProto":{"x":0,"y":-300,"text":"Interactive prototype","kind":"title1","maxW":1920},
"sProto":{"x":1000,"y":0,"w":360,"text":"Press Play on the prototype. After 3 s a detected probe appears: press Connect, then walk through flashing, reading and erase all. Settings and the log open from the titlebar buttons.","fill":"blue"},
"tWrite":{"x":0,"y":720,"text":"Flashing flow","kind":"title1","maxW":5920},
"tRead":{"x":1000,"y":1720,"text":"Reading flow","kind":"title1","maxW":2920},
"tDark":{"x":1000,"y":2720,"text":"Dark theme (follows the system)","kind":"title1","maxW":2920},
"tQuick":{"x":0,"y":3720,"text":"Quick flash","kind":"title1","maxW":1920},
"sQuick":{"x":0,"y":4000,"w":420,"text":"Quick flash: the last file and address are remembered per chip (by UID). \"Flash ⌘R\" on the device screen starts flashing right away, without the wizard. The confirmation is skipped only when the same sectors are erased as last time and \"Always confirm before erasing\" is off; otherwise the regular sheet is shown. \"When the file changes\": the app watches the .bin and re-flashes the board when the build overwrites it. Flashing starts ~1 s after the last change and does not start if the CRC is the same, another operation is running or the probe is disconnected.","fill":"orange"},
"tConn":{"x":0,"y":4720,"text":"Connecting to the probe and erase all","kind":"title1","maxW":3920},
"sConn":{"x":4000,"y":5000,"w":380,"text":"The app never connects to a probe on its own. A detected ST-Link is shown as \"disconnected\" (data from the USB descriptor); the user presses Connect. \"Disconnect\" in the device screen footer closes the USB device (drop StLink → exit debug) and returns to \"disconnected\", so VS Code, OpenOCD or st-flash can use the probe. Erase all: mass erase of both banks, only after a confirmation with a red button.","fill":"blue"},
"tSet":{"x":0,"y":5720,"text":"Settings and log","kind":"title1","maxW":2920},
"sSet":{"x":3000,"y":6000,"w":380,"text":"Settings and the log open from the buttons on the right of the titlebar (and ⌘, for Settings). Language: System / Русский / English. Log: INFO/WARN/ERROR/DEBUG levels; the USB tab shows TRACE packets, which are recorded only with \"Verbose USB log\" on.","fill":"blue"},
"tEn":{"x":0,"y":6720,"text":"English","kind":"title1","maxW":2920},
"tIcon":{"x":0,"y":7720,"text":"App icon","kind":"title1","maxW":1240}
